{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"text\": \"为难时，那份曾让他满足的柔软又短暂浮现，他认得它，舍不得马上压下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"柔软浮现\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想每次想起那份满足，都立刻拿它来审问自己。\",\n      \"key\": \"审问自己\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他终于喘过一口气，心里短暂安静下来，却已知道这份安静不会久留。\",\n      \"key\": \"短暂安静\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R40\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留为难时熟悉的柔软短暂回返、他认得它且舍不得压下去，明确这份柔软曾带给他满足。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R41\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把概括性的反问改成他不愿每次想起都立刻拿这份满足审问自己。此前真实的满足已有交代，不再重复解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R42\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S08-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把暂不去想的空否定改成短暂安静下来的实际变化，同时保留他知道安静不会久留的预感，为后面的迟疑回返留下原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ccacb36f-7588-4c40-bd54-b67d197e4463", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T144543063020Z", "elapsed_seconds": 648.61, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T14:56:31.680003+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_rememb